{"id":"vod_sn_35612","vodId":"35612","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"滑头鬼之孙","name_cn":"滑头鬼之孙","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/aba6116812e4cc760882d3f02c043a5e.jpg"},"summary":"滑头鬼，是统领着百鬼夜行的妖怪总大将。十三岁的奴良陆生（福山润 配音）看似是一名普通中学生，喜欢着同班同学家长加奈（平野绫 配音）。但其实他有四分之一的妖怪血统，是大妖怪“滑头鬼”的孙子。他被 “奴良组”众妖怪尊称为少主，身边有个叫及川冰丽（崛江由衣 配音）的亲信。但他一心只想当一个普通人类，不肯承认自己是妖怪的事实，更不愿继承奴良组三代目之位。　　四年前一次意外，使他觉醒了妖怪之血，暂时恢复了妖怪的相貌，但是到了白天，他又变回了人类的模样并且还会忘记自己是妖怪这件事。自此以来，奴良陆生仍过着平静的人类生活。但其实自觉醒之日起，他便已经立下志愿要继承奴良组三代目，站在众鬼之巅，成为魑魅魍魉之主。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":27,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A8CziPL0Te1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mbJH3D6ZLA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zGEihZZ3cv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1901hBs7db1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sW49J3YJDq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ktNGa86jjU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T01u8w6YSB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bVAJxT6rWt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/efd8MHcr7P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z4MZP1nw2U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/663WBsbkY01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nHWJLRMNQ81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2NLQ7AJm7k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7pGAZhhZAM1/video/index.m3u8"}